OL,3,GNEWSAOvernight road closures during
OL,4,A#10m town revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA week of overnight closures are due to
OL,7,Fstart as part of a #10m revamp of Long
OL,8,FEaton town centre.
OL,10,FTamworth Road will close every night
OL,11,Fbetween 19:00 and 05:00 BST from Sunday
OL,12,Funtil 10 October.
OL,14,FErewash Borough Council said the
OL,15,Fclosure was to allow work to be
OL,16,Fswitched from one side of the road for
OL,17,Fnew paving to be installed.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
