OL,3,GNEWSAOvernight road closures during
OL,4,A#10m town revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe southbound lane - between the
OL,7,Froundabout where Market Place meets
OL,8,FNottingham Road and Derby Road, and the
OL,9,Fjunction with Broad Street - was
OL,10,Falready made one-way on 2 August, which
OL,11,Fis due to continue until December.
